   "wiring": "Sensor TRIG to J2 pin 18 (PA7), ECHO to J4 pin 36 (PA10), VCC to J1 pin 1 (3V3), GND to J2 pin 20 (GND). Buzzer to J2 pin 14 (PA4), its other leg to GND.",
